   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion Program for the Internationalization of Uruguay</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Posicionar al Uruguay como un pa&#xED;s l&#xED;der en la generaci&#xF3;n y escalamiento de soluciones innovadoras que aborden los desaf&#xED;os del desarrollo sostenible mediante una mayor inversi&#xF3;n en investigaci&#xF3;n, desarrollo e innovaci&#xF3;n (I+D+i), fomentando la inversi&#xF3;n (extranjera y nacional), las exportaciones, y el empleo, en sectores de bienes y servicios de alto valor agregado en Uruguay.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Position Uruguay as a leading country in the generation and scaling of innovative solutions that address the challenges of sustainable development through greater investment in research, development and innovation (R&amp;D&amp;I), promoting investment (foreign and national), exports, and employment, in sectors of goods and services with high added value in Uruguay.</narrative>
  </description>
